WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.680
From today march north.

00:08.920 --> 00:13.920
Since this army was built in the north I grant you the name.

00:14.000 --> 00:15.400
Beishuo Army.

00:17.440 --> 00:20.880
Years of accumulation now played a huge role.

00:21.880 --> 00:26.560
Because of your reforms the treasury was full Xuan army's combat strength was abundant.

00:27.160 --> 00:30.960
And because of the late emperor's canal all supplies and provisions.

00:31.040 --> 00:36.400
Could be quickly transported from the south to the front continuously.

00:36.920 --> 00:39.040
Is my canal finished?

